## Why This Is Asked

A realistic OS problem combining containers, quotas, and NUMA pressure with batching and fairness.

## Key Concepts

- per-container quotas via cgroups
- NUMA locality hints
- per-CPU batching and cross-CPU coordination
- fairness under bursty memory pressure

- Trade-offs: latency vs throughput, batch size

